          "node_type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "node_type": "text",
              "value": " The magic of the vault maintains the natural light, temperature, and air quality of the area as it originally existed aboveground, but any magical effects that affected these qualities do not have their duration extended. For example, a sunny field would remain brightly lit indefinitely, despite being buried underground, while a "
            },
            {
              "node_type": "entity_link",
              "value": "daylight",
              "relationship_id": "spell.entomb:references:spell.daylight",
